From: XBotics AMD reproducibility protocol
Subject: [PATCH] Add frozen LIBERO states and synchronized endurance telemetry

Base: huggingface/lerobot@73dbb6f43a5088583706c91fb73c6957bca5f806

This patch separates development and confirmation initial states without changing
LIBERO rewards or success criteria. It disables video during Radeon measurements,
synchronizes policy timing with HIP, and supports persistent fixed-state repeats
interleaved across tasks for drift-balanced endurance evidence.

